[31.672674, "o", "### NOTE.txt\r\n"]
[31.673898, "o", "Desk runbook: tamp after source edits. lade a slip, then wake, then pull an id from held.\r\n\r\nIf a pull comes back empty, some shifts bump retrycue/PauseCue and wait. That path is still in the tree for the old flaky-reader hypothesis.\r\n"]
